    "created_at": "2025-04-14T18:36:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-14T18:36:36Z",
    "body": "> I will create a separate list for I2P trackers soon:\n\nThanks.\n\nBut instead of, creating a new list add them to top 20 list.\n\n**Reason for asking is** :- It will help in downloading any & all torrents [from public trackers] anonymously via I2P as well as help in cross-seeding of torrents in I2P. \n\n\n\n\n> Private trackers (registered torrents only):\n> \n> * http://opentracker.simp.i2p/a\n\nsimp.i2p is **not a private tracker but public tracker** like opentrackr.\nBelow is screenshot from their website\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0a83713d-0c1a-4ae3-9ada-e44144353aa0)",
