    "updated_at": "2025-04-16T16:29:42Z",
    "body": "> http://opentracker.simp.i2p/a\n\nYou are right. It's public.\n\nI won't add I2P trackers into other lists. Most users don't know about this protocol and if you don't have the I2P Router + Proxy running you get HTTP errors in the client. I don't want to deal with the issues.\n\nThere is a new list [trackers_all_i2p.txt](https://github.com/ngosang/trackerslist/blob/master/trackers_all_i2p.txt)\nCheckout the readme => https://github.com/ngosang/trackerslist",
